Description: Loongnix OpenJDK 21 for Debian loong64
 This package repacks the official Loongnix OpenJDK 21
 loongarch64 glibc binary tarball for Debian loong64 systems.
 It installs under /usr/lib/jvm and registers common JDK commands
 with update-alternatives.
